# Delivery artefacts. `git format-patch` output for handing work to a human — not source,
# and each one contains the full text of every commit before it, so committing them puts
# recursive copies of the history into the history. Ignored after a `git add -A` swept five
# of them into P2-06..P2-12 and the repo grew megabytes of its own patches.
*.mbox
*.patch
